// 1. Guidance updated to explicitly name all required SQL clause types (WHERE, GROUP BY,
//    HAVING, ORDER BY) with brief natural-language trigger phrases, while preserving the
//    critical "SQL: <<query>>" format so the model still emits "<<" in the preamble.
// 2. Preamble budget increased from 5 to 12 steps, giving Qwen3.5-4B room to write
//    "SQL: <<" even if the tokenizer splits "SQL", ":", " " and "<<" across more tokens.
// 3. CloseSpanWithinBudget fallback budget raised from 80 to 120 so complex SQL
