// and the four-phase structure—is unchanged from attempt 43.
//
// Attempt 58 regression cause: its guidance omitted "SQL: <<...>>" format; the model
// generated SQL in the unconstrained preamble, forcing "<<" AFTER the SQL text.
// The present attempt avoids that by keeping the format instruction front-and-center.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END

