//     currentConstrainedOut by that one parser-valid token; IsValidPrefix is preserved
//     by the parser extension postcondition.
//   EOS branch: CloseConstrainedSpan (called only when IsCompletePrefix) sets
//     insideConstrainedOut := false. If not complete, break without appending.
